5. Adapter contract

   For the KubeNeuron License (Sections 1.13, 1.14, 1.16, 2.8, and 2.9), the
   adapter contract is:

     pkg/accelerator   accelerator adapter contract and registry. A separate
                       Go module, github.com/kubeneuron/kubeneuron/pkg/accelerator,
                       with its own LICENSE file (Apache-2.0); standard
                       library only. Tags: pkg/accelerator/vX.Y.Z.
     pkg/cloud         cloud provider contract and registry, in the main
                       module.

   Registration files (the only files Registration Code may add to):

     internal/accelerator/adapters/adapters.go   accelerator adapters
     internal/cloud/providers/providers.go       cloud providers

   Documented adapter protocols for out-of-process Adapters: none published
   yet. A protocol becomes part of the adapter contract when it is listed
   here.

   Adapters that implement the adapter contract are not part of KubeNeuron;
   their authors may license and distribute them on their own terms.

